{"id":"n25367-1-8","stage":3,"title":"체조 · 体操","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25367-1-8-1","ko":"나 요즘 몸이 너무 뻐근해.","zh":"我最近身体特别酸痛。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}},{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"몸이","meaning":"身体，身子","explanation":"몸：身体，身子；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"몸","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74138","senseId":"1","lemma":"몸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몸이","audio":"/audio/5a8fb4d5acf8e6fe3214.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"뻐근해.","meaning":"酸痛，发紧，发硬","explanation":"뻐근하다：酸痛，发紧，发硬；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"뻐근하다","audio":"/audio/40572f04be98131df0ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61635","senseId":"1","lemma":"뻐근하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뻐근해","audio":"/audio/583bfc629f119c64b46a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"955149b012635be1","term":"몸","zh":"身体，身子","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3","entryId":"74138","definition":"指从头到脚组成人或动物形象的整体；或指其状态。","pronunciation":["몸"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"40572f04be98131d","term":"뻐근하다","zh":"酸痛，发紧，发硬","audio":"/audio/40572f04be98131df0ef.mp3","entryId":"61635","definition":"肌肉拽得疼痛，难以动弹。","pronunciation":["뻐근하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8beb348575ebb03b45fa.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n25367-1-8-2","ko":"그럼 자기 전에 가벼운 체조를 해 봐.","zh":"那睡前可以做点简单的体操试试。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"자기","meaning":"睡，睡觉","explanation":"자다：睡，睡觉；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。","readings":[{"term":"자다","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69511","senseId":"1","lemma":"자다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자기","audio":"/audio/1c11f639d43037d2110a.mp3"}},{"text":"전에","meaning":"上","explanation":"전：上；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"전","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17306","senseId":"2","lemma":"전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전에","audio":"/audio/2d406c50ea3b8c668815.mp3"}},{"text":"가벼운","meaning":"简单，轻便","explanation":"가볍다：简单，轻便；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"가볍다","audio":"/audio/77632f6eee12aa1b1736.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26788","senseId":"7","lemma":"가볍다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가벼운","audio":"/audio/afd244a33dff45e58232.mp3"}},{"text":"체조를","meaning":"体操","explanation":"체조：体操；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"체조","audio":"/audio/474a7ec48c0bb2d05436.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25367","senseId":"1","lemma":"체조","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"체조를","audio":"/audio/b7943f2dd40778553ec0.mp3"}},{"text":"해","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"023aa5fb34178979","term":"자다","zh":"睡，睡觉","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3","entryId":"69511","definition":"闭眼睛，停止身体、精神活动，一时进入休息状态。","pronunciation":["자다"]},{"id":"d9f427c3257e81e0","term":"전","zh":"上","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3","entryId":"17306","definition":"时间上之前的。","pronunciation":["전"]},{"id":"77632f6eee12aa1b","term":"가볍다","zh":"简单，轻便","audio":"/audio/77632f6eee12aa1b1736.mp3","entryId":"26788","definition":"做某事时所需的努力或所承受的负担少。","pronunciation":["가볍따"]},{"id":"474a7ec48c0bb2d0","term":"체조","zh":"体操","audio":"/audio/474a7ec48c0bb2d05436.mp3","entryId":"25367","definition":"按照一定的形式活动身体；或指那样的运动。","pronunciation":["체조"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/884bfc98a59760226afd.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.053,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=25367","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":112,"sequenceScore":2.8797,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那睡前可以做点简单的体操试试。","我最近身体特别酸痛。","承奎，你能帮我解释一下这个句子吗？我有几个单词不认识。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我最近身体特别酸痛。","承奎，你能帮我解释一下这个句子吗？我有几个单词不认识。","那睡前可以做点简单的体操试试。"],"answer":2}]}
